        "publishTime": "2025-01-23T13:45:15.671728Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURfbXMtay1nRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURfbXMtay1nRRAB!2m1!1s0x340407005a8c7bef:0xf2a247e3fc0cd271"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ73uMWgAHBDQRcdIM_ONHovI/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWU04xbHNSM3BqY21aa1YyaG5XVE5MWVZCc1VrRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "- 餐廳外排隊人龍非常長，但排隊管理極差，明顯有人打尖卻無人制止或安排。\n- 等候期間看到多名客人插隊，但店方職員對此毫無回應，讓人感到不公平和混亂。\n- 我多次向店員要求餐牌，但對方完全無視，毫不理會我的請求，態度冷淡。\n- 等候期間甚至沒有任何安撫或解釋，感覺員工態度極差且缺乏基本禮貌。\n- 上菜速度緩慢，期間沒有清楚的等候時間提示，令整個用餐過程非常不愉快。\n- 雖然聽說這裡的沙嗲牛肉麵味道不錯，但服務質素和管理混亂已經令我不會再來，也不會推薦給朋友。\n- 希望餐廳能改善排隊安排、員工態度和基本顧客服務，否則再好的食物也無法彌補整體體驗的失望。\n—————\n\n•\tMy recent visit to Good Luck Satay Beef Noodles was extremely disappointing.\n•\tThere was a very long queue outside the restaurant, but the queue management was terrible, and it was obvious that people were jumping the line without anyone stopping them.\n•\tDuring the wait, I witnessed several customers cutting ahead, yet the staff made no effort to address it, making the situation feel unfair and chaotic.\n•\tI asked the staff for a menu multiple times, but they completely ignored me and did not respond, showing a very indifferent attitude.\n•\tThroughout the wait, there was no explanation or friendly communication, leaving me with the impression of very poor service and lack of basic courtesy.\n•\tThe food service was slow, and there was no clear indication of how long we would have to wait, which made the experience even more frustrating.\n•\tAlthough I’ve heard good things about the satay beef noodles here, the poor service and chaotic management have convinced me that I will not return and will not recommend this place to friends.\n•\tI sincerely hope the restaurant improves its queue system, staff attitude, and basic customer service; otherwise, no matter how good the food is, it cannot make up for the overall disappointing experience.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "- 餐廳外排隊人龍非常長，但排隊管理極差，明顯有人打尖卻無人制止或安排。\n- 等候期間看到多名客人插隊，但店方職員對此毫無回應，讓人感到不公平和混亂。\n- 我多次向店員要求餐牌，但對方完全無視，毫不理會我的請求，態度冷淡。\n- 等候期間甚至沒有任何安撫或解釋，感覺員工態度極差且缺乏基本禮貌。\n- 上菜速度緩慢，期間沒有清楚的等候時間提示，令整個用餐過程非常不愉快。\n- 雖然聽說這裡的沙嗲牛肉麵味道不錯，但服務質素和管理混亂已經令我不會再來，也不會推薦給朋友。\n- 希望餐廳能改善排隊安排、員工態度和基本顧客服務，否則再好的食物也無法彌補整體體驗的失望。\n—————\n\n•\tMy recent visit to Good Luck Satay Beef Noodles was extremely disappointing.\n•\tThere was a very long queue outside the restaurant, but the queue management was terrible, and it was obvious that people were jumping the line without anyone stopping them.\n•\tDuring the wait, I witnessed several customers cutting ahead, yet the staff made no effort to address it, making the situation feel unfair and chaotic.\n•\tI asked the staff for a menu multiple times, but they completely ignored me and did not respond, showing a very indifferent attitude.\n•\tThroughout the wait, there was no explanation or friendly communication, leaving me with the impression of very poor service and lack of basic courtesy.\n•\tThe food service was slow, and there was no clear indication of how long we would have to wait, which made the experience even more frustrating.\n•\tAlthough I’ve heard good things about the satay beef noodles here, the poor service and chaotic management have convinced me that I will not return and will not recommend this place to friends.\n•\tI sincerely hope the restaurant improves its queue system, staff attitude, and basic customer service; otherwise, no matter how good the food is, it cannot make up for the overall disappointing experience.",
